1159 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Woven womenswear designer in my sixth year\054 developing outerwear\054 bottoms\054 capsules and collaborative products that connect brand identity with seasonal trends\056\n\n\200 Visualize revisions with AI and refine details based on Illustrator originals to communicate design intent clearly for overseas production\056\n\200 Compare trend forecasts and WGSN with runway collections\054 then use AI to expand everyday detail and styling references into design boards\056\n\200 Develop best\055selling bottoms with reliable fits and distinctive silhouettes that meet customer needs\054 and establish new styles as core products\056\n\200 Design outerwear across fur\054 down\054 double\055faced wool\054 leather\054 tweed and casual styles\056 Contribute to sales and improved cost ratios through high\055volume overseas production\056\n\200 Independently managed the SS22 jersey project with artist Woochul Jang\073 co\055planned a tennis capsule using athleisure materials\073 and planned apparel and accessories \050key charms\054 hangtags and labels\051 for the SS25 collaboration with director Jung Yoon\055ki\054 extending the brand\220s identity\056)
     /K [ 16 ]
     /P 1160 0 R
     /Pg 1129 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

