1169 0 obj
  << /ActualText (My strength is developing new styles into lasting core products while preserving a brand\220s identity\056 At VANESSA BRUNO ath\351\054 I have developed a range of outerwear and separates\054 creating best\055performing styles through reliable fits and distinctive silhouettes\056 This work has sharpened my eye for how texture\054 fit and small details shape a product\220s quality\056 I want to bring that experience to MUSINSA STANDARD WOMAN\054 enhancing the quality customers can feel within its accessible price range\056 I am applying to help create signature products that add considered details to everyday essentials and keep customers coming back\056\n\nAnother strength is my initiative in learning and applying new tools instead of settling into familiar ways of working\056 Before my company began offering AI training\054 I invested my own time and money in studying AI tools and using them in design\056 In a studio that uses hand\055drawn flats for initial approvals\054 I found ways to apply AI at later stages\072 research for design boards\054 visualizing revisions and refining details in technical drawings for overseas production\056 Through hands\055on use\054 I have learned which tasks benefit from AI and where a designer\220s judgment is essential\056 While exploring alternatives with AI\054 I draw on my experience to assess brand relevance\054 the feasibility of materials and silhouettes\054 and the accuracy of production details\056 I put new technology to practical use\054 beyond simply learning how it works\056\n\nI have translated varied concepts into brand products\054 from seasonal designs aligned with the Paris head office\220s products to co\055planning a tennis capsule\054 independently managing an artist collaboration\054 and planning accessories with a director\056 Developing specialty outerwear and overseas\055produced styles has taught me to consider production methods and costs alongside materials and silhouettes\056 Turning new ideas into lasting products while retaining the brand\220s character is an essential design capability\204and one of my strengths\056\n\nAt MUSINSA STANDARD WOMAN\054 I will draw on my experience in bottoms to propose fits and silhouettes that give customers clear reasons to choose them again\056 I will use AI to compare alternatives quickly and share revision directions clearly\054 while carefully assessing fit\054 fabric\054 construction and details in physical samples\056 By refining products in response to sales and connecting them with outerwear styling\054 I hope to create eye\055catching looks customers return to\056 Combining my experience in contemporary womenswear with my initiative in adopting new tools\054 I will help the brand\220s new styles become part of customers\220 everyday lives\056)
     /K [ 21 ]
     /P 1170 0 R
     /Pg 1129 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

